the end of the three-year performance period, it will lapse."]},{"type":"p","children":["2.   Ms Parry was granted a conditional award of Ordinary Shares under the terms of the GlaxoSmithKline 2017 Performance Share Plan."]},{"type":"p","children":["3.   Dividends will accrue on the conditional award of Ordinary Shares during the performance period but will only vest to the extent that the award vests at the end of the performance period. These dividends are not included in the figures below."]},{"type":"p","children":["Transaction notification"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["1."]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":5},"children":[{"type":"p","children":["Details of PDMR/person closely associated with them ('PCA')"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["a)"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Name"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":4},"children":[{"type":"p","children":["Roanne Parry"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["b)"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Position/status"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":4},"children":[{"type":"p","children":["Chief People Officer"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","child